Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:22:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/17] Add local Time Trial leaderboards with name entry

Top 10 times per track (custom tracks included), saved in leaderboards.json
next to the game. After a top-10 Time Trial a window asks for the player's
name (keyboard, or gamepad arcade-style entry); player 1's controller is held
from the game while it's open. A Leaderboards window browses every track's
board and can clear one. Replays and netplay sessions are never recorded.

See docs/LEADERBOARDS.md.

